>## @requirement swapsRowsAndColumns transpose converts a list of rows into a list of columns, where column i holds the i-th element of every row that has one; rows need not be the same length (a ragged matrix is handled by omitting absent elements, not by padding or erroring), and an empty list of rows yields the empty list.
